# DumbleDoer

DumbleDoer is an agentic engineering harness and autonomous workflow powered by Gemini.

## Installation
Run `bash install.sh` to initialize the project and dependencies.

## Usage
Run the CLI using `dumbledoer` or execute `python dumbledoer_cli.py`.
